cbmp: libraries poll the interrupt request in long C loops (Lua 5.4.7).
lstrlib: match() steps, singlematch (weighted by class length), %b scan and lmemfind
(weighted by needle length) poll every 4096 work units; string.rep of empty pieces
returns "" at once. ltablib: insert/remove/move/concat per iteration and every sort
comparison. loslib: os.date per conversion. Re-check on upgrade: MatchState, match,
singlematch, matchbalance, lmemfind, prepstate, str_rep; tinsert/tremove/tmove/tconcat/
sort_comp; os_date.

